## Timeline Summary

| Phase | Duration | Key Deliverables |
|-------|----------|------------------|
| 1. Foundation | 1-2 weeks | Project setup, architecture |
| 2. File Parsers | 1 week | All format parsers |
| 3. Coordinate Handling | 1 week | Chr ID mapper, coordinate converter |
| 4. Annotation Engine | 1 week | Fast intersection using bedtools |
| 5. UI Development | 1-2 weeks | Streamlit interface |
| 6. Testing | 1 week | Comprehensive test suite |
| 7. Deployment | 1 week | Docker, SciLifeLab deployment |
| 8. Documentation | 1 week | User guide, tutorials |
| **Total** | **8-10 weeks** | Production-ready tool |

---

## Risk Mitigation

### Technical Risks

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|
| Large file performance | High | Implement chunked processing, progress bars, file size warnings |
| Memory issues | High | Stream processing, cleanup temp files, set memory limits |
| Chromosome mismatch | Medium | Auto-detection + validation + user warnings |
| Parsing edge cases | Medium | Extensive testing with diverse datasets |

### Deployment Risks

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|
| SciLifeLab serve compatibility | Medium | Test deployment early, follow their guidelines |
| User adoption | Medium | Clear documentation, tutorial videos, example datasets |
| Support burden | Low | Comprehensive FAQ, error messages, logging |

